<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n810" root="اسى" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسٍ</span></b> , [agreeably with analogy, as part. n. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسِىَ</span>,] (M,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آسٍ</span></b>  (K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسِىٌّ</span></b>  (Msb,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْيَانُ</span></b> , (M, K,) a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْوَانُ</span>, (TA, [see
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسو</span>]) <i>Grieving, mourning,</i> or <i>sorrowful:</i>
(M, Msb, K:) fem. [of the first, or second,]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسِيَةٌ</span> (M,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آسِيَةٌ</span>, (K,) and [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسيان</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْيَانَةٌ</span>
(M, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسَيْى</span>: (TA:) pl. [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسيان</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْيَانُونَ</span>
(M, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسَايُونَ</span> [which is extr. and somewhat
doubtful] (K) and [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسيانة</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْيَانَاتٌ</span> and [of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسيى</span> or of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسِيَةٌ</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسَايَا</span> (M, K) and [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسيى</span>]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْيَيَاتٌ</span>. (K.)

